-- Soft removal of a task by the owner (Admin -> Tasks). Cancelled tasks drop out of staff lists,
-- the dashboard and the scheduler's reminder/overdue/escalation sweeps, keep their evidence and audit
-- trail, and - because the row (and its generated_key) stays - are never regenerated by the scheduler.
-- Added in its own migration: a new enum value cannot be referenced in the transaction that adds it.
alter type public.task_status add value if not exists 'cancelled';
